#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "Restore a snapshot from a ship target into a path"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid ""
"Restore snapshot <id> into --target using the named --ship entry.\n"
"\n"
"The ship's type selects the path: an \"archive\" ship replays the object chain\n"
"(rclone cat | decompress | btrfs receive); a \"restic\" ship runs restic restore.\n"
"Restore is DESTRUCTIVE — it writes a subvolume into the target — so it prompts for\n"
"confirmation unless --yes is given.\n"
"\n"
"Each subvolume's objects live under their own remote prefix, so a restore has to\n"
"know which subvolume it reads from. With exactly one subvolume configured that is\n"
"implied and --subvolume is unnecessary; with several, name one — the restore\n"
"refuses to guess rather than read another subvolume's backups."
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "path to restore the snapshot into (required)"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "name of the [[ship]] entry that drives the restore (required)"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "which configured subvolume to restore from (needed only when several are configured)"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "skip the destructive-restore confirmation prompt"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_restore.go
msgid "print the destructive restore actions without performing them"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "Roll the system back to a snapshot (snapper only)"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid ""
"Roll the system back to snapshot <id> via snapper rollback.\n"
"\n"
"Rollback is snapper-specific: it requires engine.driver = \"snapper\" and is refused\n"
"for any other engine. It is DESTRUCTIVE — snapper makes a read-write copy of\n"
"snapshot <id> the new default subvolume, so the system boots into it on the next\n"
"reboot — and prompts for confirmation unless --yes is given."
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "skip the destructive-rollback confirmation prompt"
msgstr ""

#: cmd/bentoo/snapshot_rollback.go
msgid "print the destructive rollback action without performing it"
msgstr ""

